1. Parties and covered material

"Luminovia" means Luminovia Training & Consulting, acting through the person
or legal entity that holds or is authorized to license the relevant rights.
"Project" means the Luminovia Management Tool. "Covered Material" means the
Project's source code, tests, documentation, configuration and original assets
only to the extent Luminovia owns or has secured the rights required to license
them under these terms. Third-party software, fonts, data and other separately
licensed material remain subject to their own notices and licenses.

2. Source availability and reserved rights

The source may be visible in a public repository. Visibility is not a grant of
