must give Luminovia the exploitation and sublicensing rights needed for the
Project, subject to applicable law and any third-party rights. Authorship and
non-waivable moral rights remain with the author. A contributor must identify
any employer, co-author or third-party rights that could limit the grant.

5. Contributor use after acceptance

Under these proposed terms, participation, acceptance, attribution or contact
with Luminovia grants no automatic right to use or distribute the Project. An external contributor may
receive a specified, non-transferable use right only through Luminovia's
separate express written authorization. All other use requires a separate
